<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">TEST INFORMATION</div><h1>Test format</h1><p>Four skills. Approximately 2 hours and 25 minutes.</p></div></section><section class="container section"><div class="card-grid two"><article class="panel"><div class="skill-header"><span class="pill">01</span><h2>Reading</h2><strong>45 minutes</strong></div><p>40 questions in total, including:</p><ul><li>Gap fill — 10 questions</li><li>Short texts — 10 questions</li><li>Two long passages — 20 questions</li></ul></article><article class="panel"><div class="skill-header"><span class="pill">02</span><h2>Listening</h2><strong>35 minutes</strong></div><p>35 questions in total:</p><ul><li>Short dialogues — 10 questions</li><li>Longer conversations — 10 questions</li><li>Lecture — 10 questions</li><li>Note completion — 5 questions</li></ul><p>Audio is played once and includes varied English accents.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="skill-header"><span class="pill">03</span><h2>Writing</h2><strong>50 minutes</strong></div><p>Two tasks, both double-marked:</p><ul><li>Functional email — approximately 150 words</li><li>Opinion essay — approximately 250 words</li></ul></article><article class="panel"><div class="skill-header"><span class="pill">04</span><h2>Speaking</h2><strong>Approximately 14 minutes</strong></div><p>Three parts:</p><ul><li>Interview</li><li>Long turn</li><li>Discussion</li></ul></article></div><div class="info-strip"><strong>Assessment:</strong> Each skill receives a score from 0 to 100. The overall score is the rounded average of the four skills. GEST has no pass/fail threshold.</div></section>
